      "title": "Regression test asserts before the reader has finished",
      "description": "Setting `deletedAll` does not wait for an in-flight listing request to complete. The assertion can pass before that request throws and adds its exception to `caughtExceptions`. There is also no synchronization ensuring the reader performs any request before deletion finishes. Retain the worker handle, coordinate reader startup, and wait for bounded completion before asserting so the test reliably observes concurrent-read failures.",
